

Bank Fraud Detection Using Machine Learning

Project Description

This project aims to detect fraudulent banking transactions using machine learning techniques. By analyzing transaction details such as amount, transaction type, account balance, and customer information, the model predicts whether a transaction is fraudulent (1) or legitimate (0). Fraud detection helps banks reduce financial losses and improve customer security.


---

Objectives

Analyze banking transaction data.

Clean and preprocess the dataset.

Perform Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA).

Identify fraud patterns.

Build a machine learning model to detect fraud.

Evaluate model performance using classification metrics.



