Sample Project Insights

Most transactions are legitimate, while fraudulent transactions form only a small percentage of the dataset.

High-value transactions may have a higher likelihood of being fraudulent.

Certain transaction types or locations may show higher fraud rates.

The Random Forest model often performs well for fraud detection because it can capture complex patterns in transaction data
This project is an excellent addition to a Data Science portfolio because it demonstrates practical skills in classification, anomaly detection, and financial data analysis, which are highly relevant in the banking and fintech industries.
